    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54115" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατακείω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάκειμαι</span>
			, used in imperat. and as fut., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαισάμενοι κατακείετε οἴκαδ᾽ ἰόντες</span>”
